land</placeName> machen. <note place="foot" n="1"><persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/133697436">Godoi</persName> (das Original) 21<hi rendition="#sup"><hi rendition="#aq">b</hi></hi>. <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/123943817">Avila</persName> 36<hi rendition="#sup"><hi rendition="#aq">b</hi></hi>.</note> <persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/118686704">Alba</persName> ließ dem Landgrafen entbieten: warum<lb/>
